>(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第一项是自己的收益；第二项惩罚&quot;别人比我多&quot;（嫉妒，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>）；第三项惩罚&quot;我比别人多太多&quot;（内疚，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>）。文献估计的典型排序是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha &gt; \\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>：人们更不能容忍自己吃亏的不平等。这个模型能同时解释最后通牒的拒绝阈值与独裁者的正出价；Bolton 与 Ockenfels（2000, <em>AER</em>) 的 ERC 模型给出了另一种等价的表述。注意它刻画的是对<strong>分配结果</strong>的敏感，与损失厌恶（对自己盈亏的敏感，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 见<a href=\"../prospect-theory-and-decision/loss-aversion-and-risk-attitude\">损失厌恶与风险态度</a>）是两套参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拒绝的生理成本-不公平在大脑里长什么样\">拒绝的生理成本：不公平在大脑里长什么样</h2><p>低出价被拒时，拒绝者明明在烧钱——这提示&quot;不公平&quot;本身有即时的生理惩罚。Sanfey、Rilling、Aronson、Nystrom 与 Cohen（2003, <em>Science</em>）用 fMRI 扫描最后通牒博弈中的回应者：面对不公平出价时，前脑岛（与厌恶情绪相关的区域）激活显著增强，且激活强度预测了随后的拒绝行为；同时背外侧前额叶（与认知控制相关）也被动员——拒绝是情绪与理性在颅内打架，不是一时冲动。后续经皮电刺激抑制右侧前额叶的研究（Knoch 等, 2006, <em>Science</em>）进一步发现：失去认知控制能力的被试反而<strong>更愿意接受</strong>任何出价——他们仍然觉得不公平（前脑岛照常激活），却不再有能力执行报复。</p>\n<p>这条证据链对制度设计的含义：把公平约束当成&quot;可以靠教育消除的情绪噪音&quot;是天真的；更现实的路径是为负互惠提供低成本、非暴力、程序化的出口（投诉机制、集体谈判、仲裁），否则它将以罢工、怠工、诉讼等昂贵形态自行出场。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么企业不敢随意压低工资\">为什么企业不敢随意压低工资</h2><p>礼物交换实验为效率工资理论提供了微观基础：工资不仅是价格，还是善意的信号；压到&quot;市场清算水平&quot;以下省下的成本，会被努力水平的塌方吃回去。这解释了三个现实观察——裁员降薪往往优先保护核心员工薪酬、企业宁可用奖金而非削减底薪调节成本、&quot;同工不同酬&quot;一旦曝光引发的是绩效崩塌而非单纯抱怨。反模式是把公平约束当成需要消除的摩擦：在互惠机制起作用的环境里强行引入纯交易条款（如对志愿者计时付酬），常常挤出内在动机——挤出效应的系统证据见<a href=\"altruism-and-prosocial-behavior\">利他与亲社会行为</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>最后通牒博弈的出处是 Güth、Schmittberger 与 Schwarze 1982 年发表于 JEBO 的论文，不是卡尼曼与特沃斯基的工作</li>\n<li>跨文化数据显示公平规范的强度随社会协作方式变化：马奇根加约 26%，拉马勒拉过半</li>\n<li>独裁者博弈剥离策略成分后仍有正出价——公平偏好真实但有限</li>\n<li>信任博弈（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5.16</mn><mo>→</mo><mtext>返还</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5.16 → 返还</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">返还</span></span></span></span></span>10.24）、公共品惩罚（贡献率稳在 75%+）、礼物交换构成正负互惠的证据三角</li>\n<li>Fehr-Schmidt 不平等厌恶用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 两参数统一了拒绝与给予行为，典型地 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha &gt; \\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>对管理者的启示：工资是信号不是纯价格；公平约束是效率的一部分，不是它的敌人</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"公平与互惠","id":"公平与互惠"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"最后通牒博弈：Güth 等（1982）的意外发现","id":"最后通牒博弈-g-th-等-1982-的意外发现"},{"level":3,"text":"跨文化检验：公平是文化产物","id":"跨文化检验-公平是文化产物"},{"level":2,"text":"独裁者博弈：公平感的真实边界","id":"独裁者博弈-公平感的真实边界"},{"level":2,"text":"互惠的真实证据：信任博弈与公共品惩罚","id":"互惠的真实证据-信任博弈与公共品惩罚"},{"level":3,"text":"正互惠：信任博弈","id":"正互惠-信任博弈"},{"level":2,"text":"不平等厌恶的数学化","id":"不平等厌恶的数学化"},{"level":2,"text":"拒绝的生理成本：不公平在大脑里长什么样","id":"拒绝的生理成本-不公平在大脑里长什么样"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么企业不敢随意压低工资","id":"为什么企业不敢随意压低工资"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨期选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/prospect-theory-and-decision/intertemporal-choice"},"next":{"title":"利他与亲社会行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/social-preferences/altruism-and-prosocial-behavior"}}